#: ../../../index.rst:2
msgid "Solidity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Solidity is an object-oriented, high-level language for implementing smart "
"contracts. Smart contracts are programs that govern the behavior of accounts "
"within the Ethereum state."
msgstr ""
"Solidity 是一種物件導向的高階語言，用於實作智慧合約。智慧合約是管理以太坊狀態"
"內帳戶行為的程式。"

#: ../../../index.rst:7
msgid ""
"Solidity is a `curly-bracket language <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_programming_languages_by_type#Curly_bracket_languages>`_ designed to "
"target the Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM). It is influenced by C++, Python, "
"and JavaScript. You can find more details about which languages Solidity has "
"been inspired by in the :doc:`language influences <language-influences>` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Solidity 是一種\\ `花括號語言 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_programming_languages_by_type#Curly_bracket_languages>`_\\ ，旨在針對"
"以太坊虛擬機（EVM）進行設計。它受到 C++、Python 和 JavaScript 的影響。您可以"
"在\\ :doc:`語言影響 <language-influences>`\\ 章節中找到更多關於 Solidity 受到"
"哪些語言啟發的詳細資訊。"

#: ../../../index.rst:11
msgid ""
"Solidity is statically typed, supports inheritance, libraries, and complex "
"user-defined types, among other features."
msgstr ""
"Solidity 是一種靜態型別語言，支援繼承、 程式庫和複雜的使用者定義型別等功能。"

#: ../../../index.rst:13
msgid ""
"With Solidity, you can create contracts for uses such as voting, "
"crowdfunding, blind auctions, and multi-signature wallets."
msgstr ""
"使用 Solidity，您可以建立用於投票、群眾募資、\n"
"盲拍和多簽錢包等用途的合約。"

#: ../../../index.rst:15
msgid ""
"When deploying contracts, you should use the latest released version of "
"Solidity. Apart from exceptional cases, only the latest version receives "
"`security fixes <https://github.com/argotorg/solidity/security/"
"policy#supported-versions>`_. Furthermore, breaking changes, as well as new "
"features, are introduced regularly. We currently use a 0.y.z version number "
"`to indicate this fast pace of change <https://semver.org/#spec-item-4>`_."
msgstr ""
"部署合約時，您應使用最新發布的 Solidity 版本。除了特殊情況外，\n"
"僅最新版本會收到\\ `安全性修復 <https://github.com/argotorg/solidity/"
"security/policy#supported-versions>`_\\ 。此外，重大變更以及新功能\n"
"會定期引入。我們目前使用 0.y.z 版本號\\ `來表示這種快速變更的步調 <https://"
"semver.org/#spec-item-4>`_\\ 。"

#: ../../../index.rst:23
msgid ""
"Solidity recently released the 0.8.x version that introduced a lot of "
"breaking changes. Make sure you read :doc:`the full list <080-breaking-"
"changes>`."
msgstr ""
"Solidity 最近發布了 0.8.x 版本，其中引入了許多重大變更。\n"
"請務必閱讀\\ :doc:`完整清單 <080-breaking-changes>`\\ 。"

#: ../../../index.rst:26
msgid ""
"Ideas for improving Solidity or this documentation are always welcome, read "
"our :doc:`contributors guide <contributing>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"我們隨時歡迎關於改進 Solidity 或此文件的建議，\n"
"請閱讀我們的\\ :doc:`貢獻者指南 <contributing>`\\ 以獲取更多詳細資訊。"

#: ../../../index.rst:31
msgid ""
"You can download this documentation as PDF, HTML or Epub by clicking on the "
"versions flyout menu in the bottom-right corner and selecting the preferred "
"download format."
msgstr ""
"您可以透過點擊右下角的版本彈出選單，\n"
"並選擇偏好的下載格式，將此文件下載為 PDF、HTML 或 Epub。"

#: ../../../index.rst:36
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "開始使用"

#: ../../../index.rst:38
msgid "**1. Understand the Smart Contract Basics**"
msgstr "**1. 理解智慧合約基礎知識**"

#: ../../../index.rst:40
msgid ""
"If you are new to the concept of smart contracts, we recommend you to get "
"started by digging into the \"Introduction to Smart Contracts\" section, "
"which covers the following:"
msgstr ""
"如果您對智慧合約的概念不熟悉，我們建議您\n"
"從「智慧合約簡介」章節開始深入了解，該章節涵蓋以下內容："

#: ../../../index.rst:42
msgid ""
":ref:`A simple example smart contract <simple-smart-contract>` written in "
"Solidity."
msgstr ""
"以 Solidity 編寫的\\ :ref:`簡單智慧合約範例 <simple-smart-contract>`\\ 。"

#: ../../../index.rst:43
msgid ":ref:`Blockchain Basics <blockchain-basics>`."
msgstr ":ref:`區塊鏈基礎知識 <blockchain-basics>`。"

#: ../../../index.rst:44
msgid ":ref:`The Ethereum Virtual Machine <the-ethereum-virtual-machine>`."
msgstr ":ref:`以太坊虛擬機 <the-ethereum-virtual-machine>`。"

#: ../../../index.rst:46
msgid "**2. Get to Know Solidity**"
msgstr "**2. 了解 Solidity**"

#: ../../../index.rst:48
msgid ""
"Once you are accustomed to the basics, we recommend you read the :doc:"
"`\"Solidity by Example\" <solidity-by-example>` and “Language Description” "
"sections to understand the core concepts of the language."
msgstr ""
"\"\"熟悉基礎知識後，我們建議您閱讀\\ :doc:`「Solidity 範例」 <solidity-by-"
"example>`\\ 和\n"
"「語言描述」章節，以了解該語言的核心概念。"

#: ../../../index.rst:51
msgid "**3. Install the Solidity Compiler**"
msgstr "**3. 安裝 Solidity 編譯器**"

#: ../../../index.rst:53
msgid ""
"There are various ways to install the Solidity compiler, simply choose your "
"preferred option and follow the steps outlined on the :ref:`installation "
"page <installing-solidity>`."
msgstr ""
"安裝 Solidity 編譯器有多種方式，只需選擇您偏好的選項，\n"
"並依照\\ :ref:`安裝頁面 <installing-solidity>`\\ 上概述的步驟操作即可。"

#: ../../../index.rst:57
msgid ""
"You can try out code examples directly in your browser with the `Remix IDE "
"<https://remix.ethereum.org>`_. Remix is a web browser-based IDE that allows "
"you to write, deploy and administer Solidity smart contracts, without the "
"need to install Solidity locally."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用\\ `Remix IDE <https://remix.ethereum.org>`_\\ 直接在瀏覽器中試用程"
"式碼範例。\n"
"Remix 是一個基於網頁瀏覽器的 IDE，可讓您撰寫、部署和管理 Solidity 智慧合"
"約，\n"
"無需在本機安裝 Solidity。"

#: ../../../index.rst:63
msgid ""
"As humans write software, it can have bugs. Therefore, you should follow "
"established software development best practices when writing your smart "
"contracts. This includes code review, testing, audits, and correctness "
"proofs. Smart contract users are sometimes more confident with code than "
"their authors, and blockchains and smart contracts have their own unique "
"issues to watch out for, so before working on production code, make sure you "
"read the :ref:`security_considerations` section."
msgstr ""
"由於軟體是人編寫的，因此可能存在錯誤。所以，在撰寫智慧合約時，\n"
"您應遵循既定的軟體開發最佳實踐，包括程式碼審查、測試、稽核和正確性證明。\n"
"智慧合約的使用者有時比其作者對程式碼更有信心，\n"
"而區塊鏈和智慧合約也有其獨特的需要留意問題，\n"
"因此在投入正式環境程式碼之前，請務必閱讀\\ :ref:`security_considerations`\\ "
"章節。"

#: ../../../index.rst:70
msgid "**4. Learn More**"
msgstr "**4. 了解更多**"

#: ../../../index.rst:72
msgid ""
"If you want to learn more about building decentralized applications on "
"Ethereum, the `Ethereum Developer Resources <https://ethereum.org/en/"
"developers/>`_ can help you with further general documentation around "
"Ethereum, and a wide selection of tutorials, tools, and development "
"frameworks."
msgstr ""
"如果您想了解更多關於在以太坊上建立去中心化應用程式的資訊，\n"
"`以太坊開發者資源 <https://ethereum.org/en/developers/>`_\\ 可以為您提供更多"
"關於以太坊的一般文件，\n"
"以及豐富的教學、工具和開發框架選擇。"

#: ../../../index.rst:76
msgid ""
"If you have any questions, you can try searching for answers or asking on "
"the `Ethereum StackExchange <https://ethereum.stackexchange.com/>`_, or our "
"`Gitter channel <https://gitter.im/ethereum/solidity>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果您有任何問題，可以嘗試在\\ `Ethereum StackExchange <https://ethereum."
"stackexchange.com/>`_\\ 上搜尋答案或提問，\n"
"或是在我們的\\ `Gitter 頻道 <https://gitter.im/ethereum/solidity>`_\\ 上發"
"問。"

